terms.medium_def:
A man from the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1Ch.6.20; 
only referred to as Zimmah (זִמָּה); 
son of Shimei; 
father of Joah; 
a brother of Shelomoth, Haziel, and Haran.

